From 6264323eb396c6bf092f138daac7d34802dc4445 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jr31415 <jacob@rosen4.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 21:48:37 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] Add host screen rotation (stacked layout) with inverse
 stylus mapping

--screen-rotation / NDS_SCREEN_ROTATION / [display] screen_rotation accept
0, 90, 180, 270 (degrees clockwise). Rotates the composed native 256x192
screens in the stacked layout and maps mouse input back through the
inverse so touch routing is unchanged. Book-style titles want 270.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
